#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:176
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon crashing when searching from the GNOME Shell overview with a "
"term containing an unbalanced bracket or parenthesis"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:86
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:177
msgid ""
"Fix the history file being destroyed when it had been written by a newer "
